<title>JAPAN: Kohnan Shoji to issue 5 bln yen in bonds.</title>
<headline>Kohnan Shoji to issue 5 bln yen in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Kohnan Shoji Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - New Japan Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT   five bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISSU PRICE	    MATURITY 27.Feb.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Sep.97   CONV TO 26.Feb.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 31.Jul.97  INT PAY end-Feb/Aug</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 24-30 Jul</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>NOTE: Coupon and conversion price will be decided July 23.</p>
</text>
